## Notes

- Specific contact names, email domains, and engagement details for each client are not maintained in this knowledge file. If you need contact information, ask the user. The user knows their client relationships better than this file does.

- If a user mentions a client name not on this list, ask whether it is a new engagement or a name variant of an existing one. Do not assume.

- For sensitive client data (escalations, internal commentary, financial details), keep that context in chat only — never include it in client-facing documents.

